WEBVTT

01:47.300 --> 01:51.940
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

01:52.060 --> 01:54.980
[Episode 12]
[This story is purely fictional]

02:00.070 --> 02:01.180
I gathered everyone today

02:02.350 --> 02:03.130
to discuss something.

02:03.920 --> 02:05.020
I'll cut to the chase.

02:06.040 --> 02:08.100
The Otherworld Tower is under the military hospital.

02:09.000 --> 02:10.570
I'm sure all of you are already aware of it.

02:11.710 --> 02:14.820
I investigated it with Tiezui and Laogou.

02:15.430 --> 02:17.410
We encountered many inexplicable events.

02:19.030 --> 02:20.130
But most importantly,

02:21.910 --> 02:22.730
we discovered

02:22.750 --> 02:24.850
Japanese activities underneath.

02:26.030 --> 02:28.500
Their leader is none other than Yoshiyuki Hatoyama.

02:30.000 --> 02:31.450
On the surface, he is a merchant.

02:32.120 --> 02:32.890
In reality,

02:33.680 --> 02:34.850
he's a technical expert

02:35.310 --> 02:36.170
from Japan.

02:37.310 --> 02:38.450
He and his men

02:38.990 --> 02:40.660
went underneath Changsha

02:41.800 --> 02:43.260
in search of an item.

02:44.910 --> 02:46.170
As for what it is,

02:46.960 --> 02:47.780
we don't know yet.

02:48.800 --> 02:50.340
But given his identity,

02:50.840 --> 02:52.010
it must have something to do with the war.

02:52.910 --> 02:54.950
So Master Zhang, you went down,

02:55.280 --> 02:56.450
failed to capture the Japanese,

02:56.820 --> 02:58.890
and allowed them to kidnap Laogou

02:59.190 --> 03:00.660
right under your nose instead.

03:02.750 --> 03:03.890
I was told

03:04.910 --> 03:05.940
that when you guys descended,

03:05.960 --> 03:07.340
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama was already dead.

03:08.240 --> 03:09.890
But you performed some rituals

03:10.910 --> 03:11.730
and resurrected him.

03:13.030 --> 03:13.820
Is that right, Tiezui?

03:15.430 --> 03:16.290
It's

03:17.280 --> 03:18.410
really inexplicable.

03:21.910 --> 03:22.820
You don't believe it, Master Zhang?

03:23.030 --> 03:23.820
No.

03:25.150 --> 03:26.220
It's all a trick.

03:26.710 --> 03:28.450
We just haven't figured it out yet.

03:29.160 --> 03:31.170
I don't believe in resurrection either.

03:31.590 --> 03:34.100
However, I might have a plausible explanation.

03:34.710 --> 03:36.340
Master Zhang, you said

03:36.480 --> 03:38.260
you went down with Laogou and Tiezui.

03:39.080 --> 03:40.130
You forgot someone.

03:42.120 --> 03:43.570
I heard

03:44.030 --> 03:45.730
that Miss Huo joined you too.

03:50.590 --> 03:53.060
The Huo Clan is now just a shell of its former self.

03:53.430 --> 03:54.540
It has no money

03:54.540 --> 03:55.640
or manpower.

03:55.640 --> 03:57.100
It can't survive in Mystic Nine anymore.

03:57.430 --> 03:58.010
Master Zhang,

03:59.120 --> 04:00.850
why did you bring the Huo Clan with you?

04:03.000 --> 04:03.570
What's in it for you?

04:05.080 --> 04:06.170
Not the Huo Clan.

04:06.430 --> 04:08.010
Just Xiangu.

04:09.280 --> 04:10.290
Isn't that odd?

04:11.680 --> 04:12.850
Unless...

04:19.530 --> 04:21.730
Unless you fancy Xiangu.

04:23.270 --> 04:24.810
To revitalize the Huo Clan,

04:24.870 --> 04:26.220
you lured Laogou underground

04:26.660 --> 04:28.020
and killed him with her.

04:28.160 --> 04:29.340
Then, you made up a story

04:29.510 --> 04:31.410
of the resurrection of the Japanese

04:31.720 --> 04:32.340
to fool us.

04:32.560 --> 04:33.520
Once the whole thing is over,

04:33.520 --> 04:35.610
you'll give Laogou's property to Xiangu.

04:43.190 --> 04:45.900
Chen Pi, you're also a traitor.

04:46.310 --> 04:48.490
Open your mouth again and I'll kill you.

04:48.830 --> 04:49.930
Was I wrong though?

04:50.920 --> 04:52.170
Your clan nominated you as the head

04:52.240 --> 04:53.610
because you can make them money.

04:54.070 --> 04:54.810
Listen.

04:55.120 --> 04:56.140
Sleeping with Master Zhang

04:56.290 --> 04:57.220
is a good deal.

04:57.240 --> 04:58.140
Shut up, Chen Pi.

04:58.750 --> 04:59.980
What are you on about?

05:00.510 --> 05:02.540
Master Zhang didn't know Laogou went down.

05:02.600 --> 05:05.660
I gave the order to Xiangu to descend.

05:09.190 --> 05:10.250
Does anyone have any comments?

05:15.360 --> 05:16.730
It was also my advice to Master Zhang.

05:18.390 --> 05:19.370
Miss Huo

05:19.390 --> 05:20.930
can hang upside down and descend into a salt mine.

05:21.600 --> 05:24.050
She can be useful when the situation calls for it.

05:24.070 --> 05:25.340
- She can be useful? Then I...
- Chen Pi.

05:26.310 --> 05:26.730
Enough.

05:39.800 --> 05:41.930
I don't care about Laogou's life anyway.

05:43.360 --> 05:44.460
The

05:44.480 --> 05:45.850
Otherworld Tower has collapsed,

05:45.920 --> 05:47.140
and the Japanese are gone.

05:47.510 --> 05:48.810
All we lost was a dog.

05:49.720 --> 05:50.780
I know someone called Donkey.

05:51.270 --> 05:52.580
Perhaps we can promote him.

05:53.560 --> 05:55.170
Or, let's just do it now

05:55.240 --> 05:56.410
and share Laogou's property.

05:56.630 --> 05:57.980
The Mystic Nine will become the Mystic Eight.

05:58.190 --> 05:58.610
Deal?

05:59.310 --> 06:01.140
I'll get money? Sure.

06:03.120 --> 06:03.900
30 years.

06:07.800 --> 06:08.580
30 years ago,

06:10.190 --> 06:11.930
when the Eight-Nation Alliance attacked Beiping,

06:13.160 --> 06:14.930
the royalty was too busy fighting among themselves for power.

06:17.120 --> 06:17.610
And now,

06:19.510 --> 06:21.170
is any of them still alive?

06:24.040 --> 06:26.370
The Japanese covet Northeastern China.

06:27.440 --> 06:29.050
Dandong might fall anytime soon.

06:30.150 --> 06:30.840
You think

06:30.840 --> 06:32.490
Changsha will remain unscathed?

06:34.120 --> 06:34.780
The Japanese

06:36.240 --> 06:37.660
lie in wait in the tower for many years.

06:38.430 --> 06:39.340
Laogou was kidnapped.

06:40.160 --> 06:41.170
This is not a coincidence.

06:42.310 --> 06:43.410
They wanted this to happen.

06:43.950 --> 06:45.730
They must have a plan.

06:46.920 --> 06:48.410
If we don't work together to fight back now,

06:49.060 --> 06:49.840
when the Japanese

06:49.920 --> 06:51.610
assemble their grenade launchers underneath this city,

06:51.920 --> 06:53.140
do you think they have the patience to negotiate

06:53.190 --> 06:54.170
the distribution of land with us?

06:57.000 --> 06:57.930
Listen up.

06:58.430 --> 06:59.370
None of us

07:00.720 --> 07:02.410
will be spared, let alone the Mystic Nine.

07:08.230 --> 07:08.870
Master Zhang.

07:10.800 --> 07:11.980
What do you want us to do now?

07:16.240 --> 07:17.170
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama

07:17.200 --> 07:19.250
and Laogou are probably not in Changsha right now.

07:19.870 --> 07:21.100
I have no jurisdiction to mobilize the soldiers outside the city.

07:21.950 --> 07:23.100
I need your merchants,

07:23.830 --> 07:24.490
informants,

07:25.000 --> 07:27.140
and spies to find them for me.

07:27.480 --> 07:27.850
Noted.

07:28.870 --> 07:31.370
The Hong Clan will mobilize some men.

07:33.000 --> 07:35.170
I think the Japanese merely

07:35.190 --> 07:36.460
took Laogou hostage.

07:36.680 --> 07:37.220
Impossible.

07:38.560 --> 07:39.730
They planned carefully

07:39.950 --> 07:41.460
to lure us down there for Laogou.

07:42.630 --> 07:44.370
If their target is Laogou,

07:45.070 --> 07:46.700
what about him

07:47.060 --> 07:49.410
piques the Japanese's interest?

07:49.830 --> 07:52.460
Laogou is good at taming animals.

07:53.360 --> 07:54.610
He tames dogs and birds

07:55.070 --> 07:56.490
to deliver messages.

07:57.240 --> 07:58.420
But the Japanese did not take dogs

07:58.420 --> 07:59.370
or birds with them.

07:59.370 --> 08:00.870
[Map of the Otherworld Tower]

08:00.870 --> 08:02.140
Perhaps they want

08:02.360 --> 08:03.810
Laogou's talent for taming beasts.

08:05.000 --> 08:05.610
What?

08:06.390 --> 08:09.340
Are the Japanese assembling an army of dogs

08:09.430 --> 08:10.410
or birds?

08:12.070 --> 08:13.540
Laogou's dogs are fierce,

08:13.950 --> 08:15.170
but they are not war-ready.

08:17.040 --> 08:18.220
What do the Japanese want?

08:23.160 --> 08:23.780
I see it now.

08:26.430 --> 08:28.540
Laogou is a Japanese sympathizer.

08:29.000 --> 08:30.020
He went down with you

08:30.680 --> 08:32.300
to save the Japanese.

08:33.240 --> 08:34.980
That's why he resurrected them.

08:35.000 --> 08:35.700
Impossible.

08:37.480 --> 08:38.890
I know how they left.

08:40.510 --> 08:41.300
Master Zhang,

08:41.960 --> 08:44.820
you said the tower was under the military hospital.

08:48.320 --> 08:50.270
There is an underground stream.

08:50.270 --> 08:51.750
[Waterway]

08:51.750 --> 08:53.600
If they didn't leave through the front door,

08:54.200 --> 08:55.220
the only alternative

08:56.030 --> 08:57.130
is the underground stream.

09:01.320 --> 09:03.460
[Liunian Hall A]
Third Master, you know the underground streams

09:03.630 --> 09:04.370
of Changsha well.

09:05.480 --> 09:07.010
I need to know how the Japanese left.

09:08.840 --> 09:09.820
Please show us the way.

09:10.440 --> 09:10.850
Sure.

09:13.670 --> 09:15.100
For our future,

09:15.870 --> 09:17.370
I shall come with you.

09:22.510 --> 09:23.580
Thank you, everyone.

09:39.550 --> 09:40.010
Xiangu.

09:41.750 --> 09:42.700
Stay here.

09:43.360 --> 09:44.490
I need your help for something.

09:46.750 --> 09:47.180
Okay.

09:53.550 --> 09:55.010
Do you want me to deal with Huo Wenhai?

09:55.600 --> 09:56.300
No need, Master Zhang.

09:56.790 --> 09:57.580
I know what I'm doing.

09:58.440 --> 09:59.370
Having his attention

09:59.630 --> 10:00.490
is not necessarily a bad thing.

10:01.080 --> 10:02.650
Without a flaw,

10:03.200 --> 10:04.180
we can't keep him contained.

10:04.790 --> 10:06.010
I should be the one to hold his attention.

10:06.670 --> 10:07.460
I can keep myself safe.

10:09.120 --> 10:09.850
Be careful.

10:10.080 --> 10:10.730
Worry not, Master Zhang.

10:38.750 --> 10:40.130
Who told you to enter the Otherworld Tower?

10:41.480 --> 10:42.610
Down there, we discovered

10:42.670 --> 10:44.700
that someone had been dropping supplies for the Japanese.

10:45.750 --> 10:47.340
It should be the same person who asked you

10:47.550 --> 10:48.370
to enter the tower.

10:49.390 --> 10:50.180
Who is it?

10:52.320 --> 10:53.220
Ding Qiansui.

10:54.750 --> 10:55.610
What did he ask you to do?

10:56.960 --> 10:58.060
He wanted me to explore the place

10:58.320 --> 10:59.420
and leave markings for him.

11:00.120 --> 11:02.700
I suppose he wanted to enter the tower too.

11:03.960 --> 11:04.820
However,

11:08.670 --> 11:09.490
I found

11:09.750 --> 11:11.490
many supplies for the Japanese down there.

11:11.910 --> 11:13.940
I recognize some of them.

11:15.120 --> 11:16.220
They were supplies Ding Qiansui

11:16.240 --> 11:17.420
had asked my clan to purchase.

11:18.150 --> 11:19.490
That was when I noticed

11:19.910 --> 11:21.220
that he had been working with the Japanese.

11:21.720 --> 11:23.010
And now, my clan is implicated.

11:24.440 --> 11:25.890
You entered the ponds before we did.

11:28.120 --> 11:28.940
What did you do?

11:35.910 --> 11:37.180
I'm sick of being used.

11:39.200 --> 11:41.130
So I need to find out the truth as soon as possible.

11:41.720 --> 11:43.850
I want to know what the Japanese are up to,

11:44.840 --> 11:46.010
and what Ding Qiansui

11:46.790 --> 11:48.060
is plotting.

11:48.790 --> 11:50.180
That way, I can act pre-emptively,

11:51.550 --> 11:53.060
instead of being someone's pawn.

12:00.790 --> 12:02.420
If you don't believe me, Master Zhang,

12:04.030 --> 12:05.300
you can raid my clan,

12:06.000 --> 12:08.980
or lock me up for interrogation.

12:09.630 --> 12:10.770
I defended you just now

12:11.790 --> 12:13.130
because I'm not sure if you're our enemy.

12:13.720 --> 12:14.940
You went to the Otherworld Tower alone.

12:15.030 --> 12:16.010
Once this becomes public,

12:16.360 --> 12:17.100
I'll have to punish you

12:17.120 --> 12:18.300
according to the military rules.

12:19.840 --> 12:20.580
If this happens again,

12:21.550 --> 12:22.460
I will show no mercy,

12:23.080 --> 12:23.940
regardless of your excuse.

12:26.510 --> 12:27.100
Go now.

12:28.320 --> 12:29.250
I still need your help

12:30.510 --> 12:31.940
regarding Laogou.

12:50.120 --> 12:50.940
Spill it.

12:56.510 --> 12:56.980
Master Zhang,

12:57.720 --> 12:58.850
I might

12:59.100 --> 13:00.010
have a lead.

13:00.920 --> 13:03.850
After Laogou and you went into the ponds,

13:04.670 --> 13:06.300
we found a photo among

13:06.840 --> 13:08.010
the Japanese documents.

13:08.840 --> 13:09.820
The photo

13:10.440 --> 13:11.980
depicts a statue of the Otherworld Patriarch

13:12.030 --> 13:13.250
woven with hair.

13:14.270 --> 13:14.980
As you know,

13:15.630 --> 13:18.010
not many people in this world

13:18.150 --> 13:19.460
have voluminous hair.

13:20.600 --> 13:21.530
Coincidentally,

13:21.840 --> 13:22.530
I know of such a person.

13:24.390 --> 13:26.850
At first, I thought it was just a pure coincidence.

13:27.510 --> 13:28.370
But after I came out,

13:29.240 --> 13:30.980
it continued to puzzle me.

13:33.510 --> 13:34.420
Who is she?

13:36.040 --> 13:38.300
She was a female customer who came to my father's stall

13:38.720 --> 13:40.700
for a divination a long time ago.

13:41.000 --> 13:42.610
She had really long hair.

13:42.880 --> 13:43.700
But

13:43.810 --> 13:45.370
I have never seen her since

13:46.230 --> 13:47.820
and I don't know where she is now.

13:50.200 --> 13:51.420
But don't worry, Master Zhang.

13:52.120 --> 13:52.890
This

13:52.960 --> 13:54.060
can be a lead.

13:54.480 --> 13:56.060
I'll follow up with it.

13:56.720 --> 13:57.370
Be quick.

13:58.390 --> 13:58.890
Sure.

14:01.320 --> 14:02.250
Now.

14:03.630 --> 14:04.650
Sure, Master Zhang.

14:05.320 --> 14:06.130
Goodbye.

14:19.750 --> 14:20.250
Master,

14:21.030 --> 14:22.530
so it was all Ding Qiansui's doing.

14:22.910 --> 14:23.980
But isn't he a eunuch?

14:24.670 --> 14:26.770
Why is he working with the Japanese?

14:27.360 --> 14:28.370
Not just the Japanese.

14:29.720 --> 14:31.220
He prospers in Changsha

14:31.840 --> 14:32.850
because he has support

14:32.870 --> 14:34.100
from the Americans.

14:35.240 --> 14:36.340
Americans too?

14:36.910 --> 14:38.420
His background is enigmatic.

14:39.360 --> 14:41.010
He probably is working with the Japanese

14:41.400 --> 14:42.340
and the Americans together.

14:42.840 --> 14:43.660
Getting rid of him

14:44.720 --> 14:45.330
won't be easy.

14:48.920 --> 14:49.690
Xiaoyu, Xiaojin.

14:50.030 --> 14:50.460
Yes.

14:50.710 --> 14:52.770
Investigate Ding Qiansui.

14:53.400 --> 14:54.300
I want

14:55.510 --> 14:56.620
to eradicate him.

14:56.870 --> 14:57.330
Yes.

15:13.150 --> 15:14.130
Officer Huo, you're awake.

15:22.390 --> 15:23.290
Where is the Mystic Nine?

15:23.600 --> 15:25.610
Officer Huo, you have a misunderstanding.

15:26.990 --> 15:28.730
You saw the Mystic Nine just now.

15:28.750 --> 15:29.780
In a surge of emotion,

15:30.070 --> 15:31.260
you passed out.

15:33.710 --> 15:35.050
Don't take me for a fool.

15:35.710 --> 15:37.680
You trespassed into military ground,

15:37.680 --> 15:38.500
and attacked an officer.

15:38.500 --> 15:39.440
By right, I can have all of you

15:39.440 --> 15:40.540
executed.

15:45.080 --> 15:46.010
Officer Huo.

15:46.630 --> 15:49.050
The Mystic Nine heard that I was sick,

15:49.350 --> 15:51.050
so they rushed here to check on me.

15:51.280 --> 15:53.620
They didn't know you had imprisoned me.

15:54.840 --> 15:57.340
Nonsense! My people are by the entrance.

15:57.340 --> 15:58.420
They are not blind.

16:00.910 --> 16:02.170
Wasn't Zhang Qishan here?

16:02.550 --> 16:03.290
Bring him over.

16:03.370 --> 16:04.370
I want to talk to him.

16:09.460 --> 16:10.780
Master Zhang was here.

16:11.550 --> 16:12.810
He saw that everyone barged in unlawfully

16:12.830 --> 16:14.060
and lectured everyone.

16:14.520 --> 16:17.580
He asked all of them to reflect upon themselves.

16:18.550 --> 16:19.760
He too wanted to punish

16:19.760 --> 16:21.450
the guards for their oversight.

16:22.550 --> 16:23.450
But

16:24.670 --> 16:25.980
since they are your soldiers,

16:26.550 --> 16:27.980
he didn't want to go over your head.

16:28.800 --> 16:30.890
So he asked me to tell you

16:31.440 --> 16:34.010
to deal with them accordingly.

16:35.280 --> 16:35.810
I have

16:35.830 --> 16:36.780
delivered the message to you.

16:36.910 --> 16:38.290
I feel unwell.

16:38.800 --> 16:39.980
Allow me to rest first.

16:44.550 --> 16:45.170
Officer Huo.

16:45.910 --> 16:46.700
Do

16:47.240 --> 16:48.530
relax yourself if you can.

16:49.470 --> 16:51.340
It will be bad

16:52.000 --> 16:53.580
if you fall sick in the future because of this.

16:59.110 --> 16:59.730
You...

17:04.180 --> 17:09.180
[Divination Service]

17:15.640 --> 17:16.900
After we entered the Otherworld Tower,

17:17.110 --> 17:18.500
we found a statue with hair

17:18.800 --> 17:20.620
by the corner of the main passage.

17:20.870 --> 17:23.020
The statue was around 170cm in height

17:23.110 --> 17:24.530
and looked like a living person.

17:25.110 --> 17:27.810
The hair used to make a statue

17:27.990 --> 17:29.090
is quite rare.

17:30.040 --> 17:33.180
Send the deceased off with no regrets.

17:33.640 --> 17:36.690
For the living and the lives.

17:36.800 --> 17:39.940
For the living and the lives.

17:41.360 --> 17:44.180
No more regrets, no more resentment.

17:44.670 --> 17:47.970
No more regrets, no more resentment.

17:50.110 --> 17:52.810
A mystic once claimed

17:53.390 --> 17:55.810
that the woman encountered the Otherworld Patriarch's sermon

17:56.240 --> 17:58.090
and decided to join him.

17:58.960 --> 17:59.970
Interestingly,

18:00.270 --> 18:02.460
the followers were donned in ancient attire.

18:02.710 --> 18:05.410
Their hair and accessories were not from the contemporary time.

18:05.710 --> 18:08.250
They dressed as the Otherworld Patriarch did.

18:08.830 --> 18:10.460
Further investigation

18:10.920 --> 18:12.850
[Xishan]
alleged that the hair maiden

18:13.240 --> 18:15.570
last appeared in a monastery in Xishan.

18:15.960 --> 18:17.650
Our men went there many times

18:18.110 --> 18:20.970
but due to geographical and manpower restraints,

18:21.480 --> 18:23.810
we were unable to confirm where they went.

18:24.800 --> 18:26.900
[Xishan]
This lead would be held off for now

18:27.640 --> 18:30.530
until we obtained more resources.

18:39.480 --> 18:41.020
This fate is doomed.

18:41.710 --> 18:43.060
There is no escaping it.

18:47.270 --> 18:49.020
[Alter Your Fate]
But if I risk my life for this lead,

18:50.150 --> 18:51.650
I might just get us

18:52.520 --> 18:54.250
a lifeline.

19:06.030 --> 19:06.540
Sir.

19:07.320 --> 19:09.660
Zhang Qishan allowed the Mystic Nine to trespass into Xie Residence

19:10.080 --> 19:11.250
for

19:11.270 --> 19:12.060
a meeting.

19:12.320 --> 19:13.770
He has no respect for the military rules.

19:14.200 --> 19:15.610
According to Bandits Punishment Regulations

19:15.720 --> 19:17.500
and Section 32 of Army Punishment Regulations,

19:17.680 --> 19:19.100
the Mystic Nine and Zhang Qishan...

19:19.280 --> 19:20.770
Yes, I know.

19:20.770 --> 19:21.360
[Yang Jian]

19:21.360 --> 19:22.390
[Central China Disciplinary Commissioner]
The higher up will deal with it.

19:23.070 --> 19:23.610
Sir,

19:24.960 --> 19:26.420
Zhang Qishan is obviously working

19:26.470 --> 19:27.940
with the Mystic Nine.

19:28.150 --> 19:30.530
But the city defense requires Zhang Qishan.

19:31.120 --> 19:33.130
If you're unhappy with the decision of the Ministry of War,

19:33.560 --> 19:35.420
making a call won't do it.

19:47.030 --> 19:47.570
Sir.

19:48.440 --> 19:49.860
Huo Wenhai called again

19:50.400 --> 19:51.490
to complain about Zhang Qishan.

19:51.660 --> 19:52.790
[Luo Ang, Special Forces Director]

19:52.790 --> 19:54.050
The Ministry of War

19:54.350 --> 19:55.490
wants to get rid of gangsterism.

19:56.510 --> 19:58.530
But the Mystic Nine

19:59.030 --> 20:01.090
always gets extra leeway.

20:02.590 --> 20:04.380
Is it because of Zhang Qishan?

20:05.270 --> 20:06.380
I recruited him

20:06.790 --> 20:07.980
personally back then.

20:09.550 --> 20:10.620
He carried me

20:11.550 --> 20:13.460
from the pile of dead bodies on the battlefield

20:13.790 --> 20:14.570
and saved me.

20:16.550 --> 20:18.010
My bond with Qishan

20:19.000 --> 20:20.900
goes beyond a few sentences.

20:22.640 --> 20:24.090
Are you going to spare the Mystic Nine?

20:26.550 --> 20:27.460
There's no running away.

20:30.110 --> 20:31.140
It's a national matter.

20:31.590 --> 20:34.220
Time to settle the score.

20:54.240 --> 20:55.380
Huo Wenhai is gone.

20:59.910 --> 21:02.250
Of course, he left after a chat.

21:03.720 --> 21:05.730
What brought you to my prison, Fourth Master?

21:05.920 --> 21:06.980
I wouldn't want you to contact my rotten luck.

21:08.550 --> 21:10.010
Fresh crabs from the Xiang River.

21:10.310 --> 21:11.090
Each weighs ten liang.

21:11.750 --> 21:13.220
I already gave some to the others in Mystic Nine.

21:13.350 --> 21:14.490
It's tough to get to you

21:15.350 --> 21:16.770
so I came in person.

21:17.480 --> 21:18.530
You love crabs.

21:19.000 --> 21:21.290
You'll be brokenhearted if you can't have them.

21:28.070 --> 21:29.700
You had a wager with Li

21:30.240 --> 21:31.220
when you joined the Mystic Nine.

21:31.750 --> 21:32.620
I see you still remember it.

21:33.550 --> 21:35.140
That's why you give us crabs every year.

21:35.160 --> 21:36.330
You never once forget it.

21:36.790 --> 21:37.700
Your integrity

21:38.480 --> 21:39.700
sure is outstanding.

21:40.790 --> 21:41.700
Of course.

21:42.160 --> 21:43.490
People don't like me.

21:43.550 --> 21:45.380
If I don't have a talent,

21:45.440 --> 21:46.420
how can I survive in this world?

21:47.400 --> 21:48.900
Once I make a promise,

21:49.160 --> 21:51.090
no one can break it.

21:52.000 --> 21:53.290
But that doesn't mean you should tell everyone

21:53.310 --> 21:54.460
that I love crabs.

21:55.070 --> 21:57.010
When you bring them every year, you'll say I love them.

21:57.720 --> 21:59.090
Is it because my family name

21:59.160 --> 22:00.090
is a homophone of crabs?

22:01.310 --> 22:02.090
Whatever.

22:02.110 --> 22:03.010
Just do whatever you want.

22:05.880 --> 22:07.810
Isn't it boring to be stuck in here?

22:10.440 --> 22:12.290
As you age,

22:12.960 --> 22:14.620
you realize that being able to sit in peace

22:15.480 --> 22:16.900
is also a kind of blessing.

22:17.920 --> 22:19.730
I can find a way to get you out of here.

22:20.240 --> 22:21.570
So long as you don't stay in Changsha.

22:23.270 --> 22:24.180
Why don't you work for me?

22:24.680 --> 22:25.980
It'll be more fun than where you are right now.

22:27.160 --> 22:29.010
Clearing my name

22:29.160 --> 22:29.770
is easy.

22:31.000 --> 22:32.900
But as long as I'm part of the Mystic Nine,

22:34.030 --> 22:35.730
I will still suffer the same fate.

22:36.030 --> 22:36.460
Oh?

22:37.880 --> 22:39.700
And I thought I was the only one in the Mystic Nine

22:40.510 --> 22:42.330
to know that things would not end well for us.

22:43.000 --> 22:44.090
The Mystic Nine exists

22:44.680 --> 22:45.810
for a good reason.

22:46.200 --> 22:47.140
But this reason

22:48.920 --> 22:50.530
will not exist forever.

22:51.720 --> 22:52.810
When the world is in turmoil,

22:53.000 --> 22:53.940
society is in chaos.

22:55.060 --> 22:56.380
Our leaders are busy fighting wars,

22:57.550 --> 22:59.420
while the people can hardly fill their tummies.

22:59.880 --> 23:01.090
Without the restraint of power,

23:01.310 --> 23:02.900
an interim system of governance appeared

23:02.920 --> 23:04.050
among the people.

23:04.510 --> 23:05.380
The Mystic Nine

23:07.270 --> 23:09.180
was born out of necessity.

23:09.920 --> 23:11.700
We're not the good people,

23:12.030 --> 23:14.380
but we give the poor a way to live.

23:15.550 --> 23:18.460
Now that a new order has been established,

23:18.750 --> 23:20.330
the foundation on which the Mystic Nine was built

23:20.350 --> 23:21.490
has collapsed.

23:21.790 --> 23:22.700
In this world,

23:23.840 --> 23:25.650
grassroots organizations like the Mystic Nine

23:25.650 --> 23:26.530
are not only redundant,

23:27.270 --> 23:29.560
but also a threat to be uprooted.

23:30.070 --> 23:32.220
Relics of the past will be gone eventually.

23:33.070 --> 23:34.050
No point lamenting it.

23:37.550 --> 23:40.010
Why not just protect yourself first?

23:41.830 --> 23:44.090
I can kill Huo Wenhai for you.

23:44.640 --> 23:46.730
As usual, 100 wen and we have a deal.

23:48.000 --> 23:49.380
If my clan wants to come out unscathed,

23:50.160 --> 23:52.220
it cannot do it alone.

23:52.750 --> 23:54.730
The Mystic Nine is in the same boat.

23:54.920 --> 23:56.620
If the higher-up doesn't want the Mystic Nine anymore,

23:56.750 --> 23:58.290
they will get rid of us.

23:58.640 --> 24:00.180
That's why they sent Huo Wenhai here.

24:00.480 --> 24:01.810
He was part of the Mystic Nine.

24:02.160 --> 24:04.140
He knows the Mystic Nine well.

24:04.400 --> 24:06.050
If he wants to climb,

24:06.200 --> 24:07.420
he needs to prove

24:07.680 --> 24:09.490
that he has severed ties with the Mystic Nine.

24:09.830 --> 24:11.330
He won't show mercy.

24:11.680 --> 24:13.460
He will use everything he can

24:13.480 --> 24:14.530
to get rid of the Mystic Nine.

24:14.880 --> 24:16.380
Once the Ministry of War gets rid of the Mystic Nine,

24:16.680 --> 24:18.620
it'll be a transformative event.

24:18.960 --> 24:20.050
If one Huo Wenhai can't do it,

24:20.310 --> 24:20.940
they'll send ten.

24:21.270 --> 24:22.730
If not, a thousand

24:22.960 --> 24:23.660
or ten thousand.

24:24.000 --> 24:26.010
The Mystic Nine is destined to fall.

24:26.240 --> 24:29.530
You and I can't escape from it.

24:30.790 --> 24:32.330
Since you already know that,

24:33.000 --> 24:34.010
why can't you let go of it?

24:34.750 --> 24:36.220
Yes, I already know

24:37.000 --> 24:38.250
that the Mystic Nine will fall.

24:38.720 --> 24:39.490
But we

24:41.000 --> 24:42.330
have a new variable now.

24:46.310 --> 24:47.090
What is it?

24:49.750 --> 24:50.490
Fifth Master.

24:51.720 --> 24:52.620
Wu Laogou.

24:55.860 --> 24:59.100
[Caopan Mountain]

25:12.200 --> 25:13.050
You're awake.

25:28.880 --> 25:30.250
Don't ask me where you are.

25:31.030 --> 25:32.050
Just know that

25:33.640 --> 25:34.460
you can't get out.

25:35.770 --> 25:36.940
You came back to life.

25:38.110 --> 25:39.090
Are you a human or a ghost?

25:39.400 --> 25:41.770
No one can come back to life in this world.

25:42.350 --> 25:43.460
But I saw it myself.

25:45.880 --> 25:46.660
Guess then.

25:47.310 --> 25:49.140
You have all the time in the world.

25:50.510 --> 25:52.010
How did we pull that off?

25:58.550 --> 25:59.980
Anyone else would have assumed

26:00.830 --> 26:02.090
that it was a spell.

26:11.830 --> 26:12.420
Yes.

26:13.680 --> 26:15.090
That's what is so great

26:15.510 --> 26:16.770
about the Chinese.

26:17.030 --> 26:18.860
No, I mean your ancestors.

26:19.400 --> 26:20.700
Not the modern Chinese.

26:21.480 --> 26:23.040
During my first two years in the tower,

26:23.040 --> 26:24.620
I too thought spells were real.

26:25.070 --> 26:26.460
I was as shocked as you are.

26:26.750 --> 26:27.730
But spells

26:29.830 --> 26:31.010
don't exist in this world.

26:32.030 --> 26:33.490
So you're saying what I've experienced

26:34.720 --> 26:35.900
is just an illusion.

26:40.160 --> 26:40.810
Not an illusion.

26:41.030 --> 26:42.250
But not a spell either.

26:42.750 --> 26:43.660
It's technology.

26:44.350 --> 26:46.490
A wondrous technology.

26:53.000 --> 26:53.810
Technology?

26:54.550 --> 26:55.050
Yes.

26:55.880 --> 26:58.380
Your ancestors several millennia ago

26:58.440 --> 27:00.490
mastered this technology.

27:02.200 --> 27:03.250
But the Chinese now

27:03.400 --> 27:04.860
do not know it.

27:04.880 --> 27:06.050
You think it's spells.

27:08.270 --> 27:09.330
You scoundrel.

27:10.590 --> 27:11.860
What are you on about?

27:12.270 --> 27:13.330
You don't need to know.

27:24.240 --> 27:25.380
Stand up, Fifth Master.

27:26.310 --> 27:27.090
Come. Fifth Master.

27:28.720 --> 27:29.250
Fifth Master.

27:30.830 --> 27:31.900
I brought you here

27:32.160 --> 27:33.810
to help me tame

27:33.920 --> 27:34.900
a special animal.

27:36.310 --> 27:37.050
I'll count on you.

27:38.750 --> 27:39.860
Without it,

27:41.400 --> 27:43.860
I can proceed with my next plan.

27:44.960 --> 27:45.620
No, I refuse.

27:52.590 --> 27:54.730
I have Unit 401 now.

27:57.510 --> 27:59.620
The Unit 401 Zhang Qishan asked you

27:59.720 --> 28:00.940
to find.

28:02.920 --> 28:04.010
If you won't help me,

28:04.790 --> 28:08.330
I'll kill them one by one.

28:09.350 --> 28:09.940
When that happens,

28:10.480 --> 28:11.610
your promise to Zhang Qishan

28:11.610 --> 28:12.730
can never be delivered.

28:13.350 --> 28:15.980
And your wish will never come true.

28:18.200 --> 28:19.420
When a soldier steps on the battlefield,

28:20.830 --> 28:22.290
he is prepared to sacrifice his life.

28:23.350 --> 28:24.420
I'm a bandit,

28:25.640 --> 28:26.570
but I share the same sentiment.

28:36.160 --> 28:37.010
No.

28:37.880 --> 28:38.900
I beg to differ.

28:39.880 --> 28:41.050
In my research,

28:41.440 --> 28:44.810
soldiers and bandits are not the same thing.

28:45.070 --> 28:46.490
Piss a bandit off

28:47.110 --> 28:48.940
and they might kill your emperor.

28:58.270 --> 28:59.290
Fifth Master,

29:02.550 --> 29:04.700
let me share a story with you.

29:06.270 --> 29:09.220
It'll answer your questions.

29:10.200 --> 29:13.050
Four years ago, I entered the Otherworld Tower in Changsha

29:13.400 --> 29:15.620
to find out the secret of Yin Changsheng.

29:16.480 --> 29:17.980
I was stuck underground

29:18.070 --> 29:19.330
for three years.

29:20.310 --> 29:21.560
Until the first parasite

29:21.560 --> 29:23.230
[Torii Totori, Hatoyama's Superior]
among you appeared.

29:23.880 --> 29:25.700
Things finally took a turn for the better.

29:26.530 --> 29:28.510
I thought with enough money,

29:28.590 --> 29:30.420
this problem would be solved.

29:30.750 --> 29:32.530
After all, humans are greedy.

29:34.000 --> 29:35.420
To my dismay,

29:36.590 --> 29:38.620
after spending so much time,

29:38.640 --> 29:40.980
they only found Ding Qiansui.

29:42.240 --> 29:43.980
He took his time

29:44.030 --> 29:46.140
to leverage the Huo Clan.

29:47.030 --> 29:49.180
But by then, we almost

29:49.200 --> 29:50.620
starved to death.

29:50.680 --> 29:52.620
We almost gave up.

29:54.000 --> 29:56.420
Ding Qiansui took our funds

29:57.400 --> 29:59.140
and bought the Huo Clan.

30:00.750 --> 30:04.980
If your clan wants to remain in the Mystic Nine,

30:06.160 --> 30:09.860
you'll need help.

30:10.720 --> 30:12.050
I have the money

30:13.830 --> 30:16.010
and the connections.

30:17.310 --> 30:21.420
But you'll need to help me out too.

30:36.160 --> 30:37.290
We can help you,

30:38.830 --> 30:40.530
but you'd better keep your promise.

30:41.790 --> 30:44.620
The Huo Clan has its own acquisition channel

30:45.440 --> 30:47.490
that evades even Zhang Qishan's supervision.

30:48.590 --> 30:49.220
So,

30:49.590 --> 30:51.900
they kept providing supplies to us

30:52.510 --> 30:56.900
without anyone knowing.

31:12.510 --> 31:14.700
As I explored the tower,

31:15.350 --> 31:17.700
I found a crack on the mountain.

31:18.270 --> 31:19.860
It leads to the world outside.

31:20.830 --> 31:22.700
It's too small for a human to squeeze through,

31:23.400 --> 31:26.660
but it's big enough for other things.

31:27.480 --> 31:31.490
For example, Ding Qiansui can drop us supplies.

31:43.110 --> 31:43.570
Come.

31:46.830 --> 31:47.460
Keep up.

31:54.270 --> 31:55.180
Put it here.

31:55.200 --> 31:55.700
Yes.

31:56.350 --> 31:57.490
With food,

31:57.880 --> 31:59.940
our living conditions underground stabilized.

32:00.480 --> 32:02.700
I knew I couldn't leave the tower this soon,

32:02.720 --> 32:04.770
so I focused on the secrets of the tower.

32:05.680 --> 32:08.490
First, I studied all three of Yin Changsheng's spells.

32:09.070 --> 32:09.940
Then,

32:09.960 --> 32:12.010
I figured out the science behind the making of those monsters.

32:12.750 --> 32:13.860
Most importantly,

32:15.000 --> 32:16.460
I found a pill.

32:16.880 --> 32:19.330
Once taken, it makes your body mutate.

32:20.200 --> 32:23.140
I tested it on my subordinate.

32:51.830 --> 32:54.330
And finally, we have a man

32:54.510 --> 32:55.940
who can climb the cliff

32:56.270 --> 32:57.730
to leave the Otherworld Tower.

33:23.680 --> 33:27.980
Ding Qiansui, these are the pills.

33:39.510 --> 33:43.940
I was stuck in the tower for three years.

33:48.270 --> 33:49.220
In these three years,

33:50.920 --> 33:52.090
I figured out

33:52.110 --> 33:53.810
almost all the secrets in this tower.

33:55.200 --> 33:56.250
The Otherworld Tower

33:57.350 --> 33:59.380
is but a carefully designed

33:59.400 --> 34:00.620
scheme.

34:02.640 --> 34:04.570
As my research continued,

34:05.070 --> 34:06.290
I discovered that the Otherworld Tower

34:06.680 --> 34:08.380
was just an entrance

34:09.190 --> 34:11.860
to a more mystical place.

34:15.230 --> 34:17.380
Is this a place accessible only

34:18.070 --> 34:19.260
through the underground streams?

34:19.800 --> 34:21.300
As expected of the Fifth Master.

34:23.030 --> 34:23.820
You're smart.

34:24.960 --> 34:25.530
Yes.

34:26.480 --> 34:28.050
We travelled several hundred kilometers

34:28.590 --> 34:29.690
on the underground stream

34:30.400 --> 34:32.420
until we reached a hidden exit that leads

34:32.510 --> 34:33.260
to this place.

34:35.320 --> 34:37.210
But this place isn't the destination

34:37.230 --> 34:37.980
of our trip.

34:38.880 --> 34:40.320
To reach the destination,

34:40.600 --> 34:41.650
we need your help.

34:42.480 --> 34:43.380
So, I had no choice

34:43.890 --> 34:45.170
but to kidnap you.

34:46.000 --> 34:47.780
But I couldn't do it in Changsha.

34:48.440 --> 34:49.900
That'd be too risky.

34:51.000 --> 34:51.740
Therefore,

34:53.030 --> 34:54.940
you lured me to you.

34:55.880 --> 34:56.690
That's right.

34:57.550 --> 34:59.780
I had Ding Qiansui make an old stone tablet.

35:00.150 --> 35:02.340
Then, I bought several men on Unit 401

35:02.800 --> 35:04.740
so that they could tell the rest to dig it.

35:05.070 --> 35:06.530
They would spread rumors

35:06.960 --> 35:08.530
to compel the rest to join them.

35:10.150 --> 35:11.610
The pills had already been ground

35:12.150 --> 35:14.010
and mixed with the soil.

35:15.230 --> 35:16.530
When they dug,

35:17.190 --> 35:18.490
mud would get on them.

35:19.000 --> 35:20.210
They would be poisoned

35:21.040 --> 35:23.140
and become docile.

35:24.470 --> 35:25.900
Then, I had my men

35:26.150 --> 35:27.580
lead them to the Otherworld Tower

35:28.520 --> 35:30.020
to lure Zhang Qishan.

35:30.990 --> 35:31.540
And finally,

35:34.200 --> 35:35.020
you came.

35:36.710 --> 35:38.130
Why didn't you ask your men

35:39.000 --> 35:40.260
to kidnap me right away?

35:41.590 --> 35:43.380
You think I've never tried that?

35:44.220 --> 35:49.700
[Wu's Residence]

36:09.590 --> 36:11.740
I know Zhang Qishan's and your capabilities very well.

36:12.630 --> 36:14.090
Once the Otherworld Tower became public,

36:14.670 --> 36:16.980
we only had one shot.

36:17.670 --> 36:19.260
So, I took a gamble.

36:23.110 --> 36:24.010
Why did you

36:24.880 --> 36:26.460
let me perform those three spells?

36:29.760 --> 36:30.690
Don't pin that on me.

36:32.550 --> 36:35.130
I did not ask you to perform those three spells.

36:35.630 --> 36:37.490
It was all in your head.

36:38.030 --> 36:38.740
Oh, humans

36:39.150 --> 36:41.210
and their imagination.

36:41.840 --> 36:43.050
Be it spells

36:43.230 --> 36:44.490
or whatever wonderful thing

36:44.510 --> 36:45.720
in this world,

36:45.720 --> 36:47.820
they are all your imagination.

36:48.770 --> 36:50.620
So, I misjudged the situation.

36:52.110 --> 36:54.130
You did not force me to carry out the spells.

36:55.630 --> 36:56.860
It was all in my head.

37:01.000 --> 37:02.260
What is wrong with you?

37:04.800 --> 37:06.490
Are you sure there were three spells?

37:08.550 --> 37:10.780
Are you sure you made a judgment?

37:11.150 --> 37:13.420
Are you sure there even are spells?

37:15.480 --> 37:16.170
What do you mean?

37:16.630 --> 37:17.460
Explain now.

37:18.800 --> 37:20.570
The confusion you feel now

37:21.440 --> 37:24.130
is the effect of the secret.

37:25.230 --> 37:26.490
It is that secret

37:28.000 --> 37:29.610
that makes the spells in the tower

37:29.670 --> 37:31.460
look so realistic.

37:32.230 --> 37:33.780
It makes everyone believe

37:34.000 --> 37:36.900
that the Otherworld Patriarch used it to establish a cult,

37:37.190 --> 37:39.090
that Yin Changsheng was a real immortal.

37:39.400 --> 37:42.740
Their followers believed vehemently in their powers.

37:43.190 --> 37:46.090
You are a follower too.

37:47.630 --> 37:49.260
We, the Japanese, are always honest.

37:50.280 --> 37:50.860
Allow me

37:52.400 --> 37:54.260
to tell you everything.

37:55.710 --> 37:56.530
A toast to me?

38:05.360 --> 38:06.170
Of course.

38:07.070 --> 38:08.530
Feel free to think of this

38:09.550 --> 38:11.130
as a victory lap.

38:13.400 --> 38:15.570
After all, my plan

38:15.710 --> 38:17.460
took three years to come to fruition.

38:19.190 --> 38:21.530
I studied you for three years.

38:22.230 --> 38:22.900
Fifth Master,

38:23.880 --> 38:24.530
I've been waiting

38:25.480 --> 38:26.860
for this moment.

38:29.960 --> 38:30.420
Oh.

38:31.110 --> 38:32.820
The Huo Clan played a part in everything.

38:33.480 --> 38:35.170
Huo Xiangu isn't aware of it.

38:35.880 --> 38:36.900
But as the head of the clan,

38:37.840 --> 38:40.130
if people find out that her clan is working with the Japanese,

38:40.590 --> 38:41.860
she will be held accountable.

38:42.760 --> 38:43.940
If you refuse to help me,

38:44.760 --> 38:46.940
she won't die in our hands.

38:47.710 --> 38:50.900
She will die in the hands of the Ministry of War's Spy Execution Squad.

38:52.760 --> 38:54.010
I know you still want to escape.

38:54.800 --> 38:55.820
But at this point,

38:56.800 --> 38:59.570
you might as well tame that creature for me

39:00.550 --> 39:01.820
while you find an opportunity to escape.

39:03.000 --> 39:03.490
Anyway.

39:04.510 --> 39:04.980
Mr. Wu.

39:06.000 --> 39:06.860
Let's start tomorrow.

39:07.320 --> 39:08.010
I'll count on you.

39:08.820 --> 39:11.340
[Li's Residence]

39:11.590 --> 39:13.490
My son, say "Father."

39:15.150 --> 39:17.340
Say "Father" and you'll have good food tonight.

39:18.800 --> 39:19.420
Say "Father."

39:19.710 --> 39:20.650
What is going on?

39:24.710 --> 39:25.610
Take him away and play with him.

39:26.590 --> 39:27.600
- Go play. - Go.

39:27.600 --> 39:28.310
- Come. - Go.

39:29.280 --> 39:30.960
- Go play now. - Go.

39:37.550 --> 39:39.210
How many times have I told you?

39:40.000 --> 39:42.050
Don't teach him the wrong thing.

39:42.810 --> 39:44.150
[Fu Chunhua, Sister-in-law]
People will talk.

39:44.710 --> 39:45.740
So what?

39:46.480 --> 39:48.130
My brother passed away many years ago.

39:49.400 --> 39:51.090
Your son is already this big,

39:51.230 --> 39:52.980
but you still refuse to move into this yard.

39:54.230 --> 39:55.860
What if people talk behind your back?

39:56.320 --> 39:57.210
I'm not afraid of that.

39:58.110 --> 39:59.340
I'm a woman.

39:59.360 --> 40:00.680
I hardly venture out.

40:00.680 --> 40:01.420
What's there to be afraid of?

40:02.110 --> 40:03.210
But you're different.

40:04.190 --> 40:06.010
You're Third Master of the Mystic Nine.

40:06.360 --> 40:07.210
And?

40:08.710 --> 40:09.980
I'm just an ordinary man.

40:10.590 --> 40:11.360
I have survived

40:11.360 --> 40:12.980
worse.

40:13.840 --> 40:14.980
If you hadn't protected me back then,

40:15.000 --> 40:16.260
I would have died in the ditch.

40:19.670 --> 40:21.300
Chunhua, what is bothering you?

40:23.670 --> 40:24.610
If you don't like my dirty deeds,

40:25.000 --> 40:26.260
I can just retire now.

40:27.190 --> 40:29.010
Aren't you supposed to work with Master Zhang?

40:30.230 --> 40:31.460
Pack up now.

40:32.880 --> 40:33.380
See you.

40:46.190 --> 40:46.650
San'er.

40:47.960 --> 40:48.420
San'er.

40:50.800 --> 40:51.300
Third Master.

40:51.670 --> 40:52.130
Come here.

40:53.630 --> 40:54.860
- Chunhua is... - Third Master.

40:55.400 --> 40:56.610
Don't you have a trip with Master Zhang?

40:57.000 --> 40:57.900
Let me pack your things.

41:10.100 --> 41:12.380
[Files]

41:40.110 --> 41:40.860
Impossible.

41:41.960 --> 41:43.530
No records on Ding Qiansui?

41:48.440 --> 41:49.980
He prospers in Changsha

41:50.360 --> 41:51.380
because he has support

41:51.400 --> 41:52.650
from the Americans.

42:00.630 --> 42:01.420
Bring Third Master over.

42:01.590 --> 42:02.050
Yes!

42:02.760 --> 42:03.210
Master.

42:05.190 --> 42:05.860
Third Master is here.

42:06.030 --> 42:06.780
He wants to see you by the entrance.

42:10.980 --> 42:15.580
[Changsha Defense Headquarters]

42:21.150 --> 42:21.690
Third Master.

42:23.190 --> 42:24.130
You're here, Master Zhang.

42:26.200 --> 42:26.820
Where are your men?

42:27.200 --> 42:27.780
On standby.

42:30.160 --> 42:31.490
That's all you're bringing?

42:32.270 --> 42:33.660
A few elite soldiers will do.

42:36.680 --> 42:38.250
I brought 300 men.

42:38.600 --> 42:39.290
That's a lot.

42:40.590 --> 42:41.920
It sure seems like it.

42:43.030 --> 42:43.530
What about this?

42:44.840 --> 42:45.690
Let's not bring anyone.

42:47.600 --> 42:48.210
For our peace.

42:55.870 --> 42:57.180
We're looking for an underground stream.

42:57.830 --> 42:58.860
So why are we going up to a mountain?

43:00.240 --> 43:01.860
Master Zhang, you are good at the arts of war.

43:02.520 --> 43:03.580
But you don't know geography well.

43:03.920 --> 43:05.940
The underground stream is an ancient waterway.

43:06.790 --> 43:08.500
The mountain layout has already changed,

43:10.320 --> 43:12.010
but there is an opening at the foot of the mountain.

43:12.240 --> 43:13.130
We can enter through it.

43:15.920 --> 43:17.580
How long will it take?

43:18.830 --> 43:19.860
Two to three days.

43:35.080 --> 43:35.730
I'm tired.

43:36.190 --> 43:37.060
Let's rest here.

43:49.190 --> 43:50.690
Will you push me off, Master Zhang?

43:51.000 --> 43:52.050
No.

43:52.630 --> 43:53.210
Oh?

43:54.920 --> 43:56.740
Everyone in the Mystic Nine has done it,

43:57.230 --> 43:58.820
except you.

44:00.190 --> 44:01.460
Tiezui too?

44:02.670 --> 44:03.820
I looked at him in his eyes.

44:03.880 --> 44:05.130
He certainly thought about it.

44:06.070 --> 44:07.260
But unfortunately,

44:08.630 --> 44:09.900
his hands were too shaky.

44:12.000 --> 44:13.690
You're enjoying it, Third Master.

44:13.960 --> 44:14.570
No?

44:19.070 --> 44:20.690
I think my killer

44:21.070 --> 44:22.380
isn't born yet.

44:23.590 --> 44:24.820
The higher you climb,

44:25.400 --> 44:26.860
the harder you fall.

44:28.320 --> 44:29.260
But think about it.

44:30.190 --> 44:32.010
If you don't climb this high,

44:33.230 --> 44:34.610
you won't get

44:34.920 --> 44:36.650
a view this great.

44:37.280 --> 44:37.940
Don't you agree?

44:39.110 --> 44:40.570
Given your financial prowess,

44:41.360 --> 44:42.820
have you thought about retiring

44:43.480 --> 44:44.740
and living some peaceful days?

44:48.710 --> 44:50.530
The men behind me

44:50.710 --> 44:52.260
count on me to feed their tummies.

44:52.920 --> 44:53.490
And then,

44:55.190 --> 44:57.690
there are many more who want me dead.

44:59.670 --> 45:01.170
So if I

45:02.110 --> 45:03.300
retire,

45:03.840 --> 45:05.130
I won't even have to do much

45:05.630 --> 45:07.260
to meet my maker.

45:09.030 --> 45:09.530
Master Zhang,

45:10.670 --> 45:11.900
if you were me,

45:12.760 --> 45:13.570
would you retire?

45:20.030 --> 45:20.740
See?

45:21.800 --> 45:22.900
Don't think too far ahead.

45:23.360 --> 45:24.740
There's no point.

45:26.760 --> 45:29.050
The Japanese made a mess.

45:30.030 --> 45:31.610
Let's just figure out how to deal with them.

45:32.800 --> 45:34.420
I bet the Japanese would never see this coming,

45:35.000 --> 45:35.900
that one day,

45:36.280 --> 45:37.900
a cripple like me would be the one

45:37.920 --> 45:38.690
to stop them.

45:41.360 --> 45:42.780
Don't sell yourself short, Third Master.

45:43.840 --> 45:44.740
You've always

45:45.590 --> 45:48.050
been the purest among us in the Mystic Nine.

45:50.000 --> 45:53.490
The rest has changed more or less.

45:55.630 --> 45:57.210
I hope you can always

45:58.670 --> 45:59.490
stay true to yourself.

46:25.220 --> 46:29.380
♪The past fades like smoke♪

46:29.740 --> 46:32.460
♪A choice is made in silence♪

46:32.740 --> 46:35.540
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

46:35.940 --> 46:39.700
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

46:39.940 --> 46:43.380
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

46:43.660 --> 46:47.060
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

46:47.140 --> 46:54.420
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

46:54.860 --> 46:58.140
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

46:58.420 --> 47:01.660
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

47:01.820 --> 47:05.860
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

47:06.060 --> 47:09.420
♪Who believes in fate?♪

47:09.660 --> 47:13.020
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

47:13.260 --> 47:16.540
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

47:16.860 --> 47:20.540
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

47:20.740 --> 47:23.980
♪Take care♪

47:23.980 --> 47:26.540
♪We once raced♪

47:26.620 --> 47:28.540
♪For the dawn♪

47:28.700 --> 47:31.980
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

47:32.100 --> 47:35.380
♪In the web of fate♪

47:35.380 --> 47:38.580
♪No one can escape♪

47:39.580 --> 47:41.420
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

47:41.580 --> 47:43.140
♪We too were young once♪

47:43.220 --> 47:46.660
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

47:46.860 --> 47:49.180
♪Keep the ember lit♪

47:49.300 --> 47:53.820
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

47:53.940 --> 47:56.900
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

47:57.140 --> 48:00.660
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

48:00.780 --> 48:04.540
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

48:04.860 --> 48:08.340
♪Who believes in fate?♪

48:08.500 --> 48:11.500
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

48:11.740 --> 48:15.500
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

48:15.660 --> 48:19.380
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

48:19.500 --> 48:30.940
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
